WEBVTT

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:55.090
See you next time!

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:07.800
Well, everything we have today is due to violence, but the situation has changed.

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:10.830
We can no longer kill and burn, right?

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:12.840
Yes, that's right.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:14.820
Let's get to the point.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:18.660
Two days ago, your husband stopped our stock in a house.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:21.790
Wait, that's not true, that's nonsense.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.580
Well, don't you take responsibility?

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:27.100
No, why?

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.440
Will you pay?

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:29.820
It can't be.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.200
I don't want you to sell without my help.

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:32.850
It's clear as day.

00:01:33.430 --> 00:01:35.060
Take it as a lesson.

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:36.300
What?

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:43.240
What? You lost two souls.

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:43.840
Are you happy?

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:46.200
It was just a misunderstanding.

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:47.760
Don't kill me, don't kill me.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:51.450
Don't kill me.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:55.460
Okay, I won't kill you.

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:57.160
Thank you, thank you.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.590
Why did you promise not to kill me?

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:05.030
I wasn't.

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:11.770
Boss, do you have that?

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:17.270
You're unemployed.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:18.910
Give it to me.

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.480
Thank you, boss! Thank you!

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:32.910
Take them.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:33.810
What is this?

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:34.430
Money.

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:35.920
Come on, take them.

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:37.570
What's the condition?

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.130
Chen wants you to forget.

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:40.230
I can't.

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:41.760
I have to sue him.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:44.820
He raped me.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.520
Do it for your own good.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:47.150
Why?

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:48.620
What are you talking about?

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:50.150
You will lose the case.

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:56.070
Instead of offending the chief, take the money and his friendship.

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:58.050
You don't know what the judge will decide.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.120
We don't know anything.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:04.600
Mr. Loon, how are you?

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:06.960
Who are you?

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:08.080
What do you mean?

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:08.940
These are Chen's maimons.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:11.950
Cut the crap, bitch!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.710
Hey, don't touch her.

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:16.450
Mr. Loon, don't mess with her.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.250
This is between us, got it?

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:24.480
Don't mess with her!

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:38.980
Get off of me!

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:45.670
Get off of me!

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:48.800
Get off of me!

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:03.680
No!

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:04.320
No!

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.010
Say it again!

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.970
Are you okay?

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:16.360
You're just like them!

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:32.820
I object to making guesses about the motives of the victims.

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:40.040
A dancer makes a lot of good money.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:41.780
More than me and you.

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:45.100
As we all know, money often ruins people.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:46.320
Get out of here.

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:49.400
In order to save the court a lot of time and money,

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:52.200
the prosecution will not seek compensation.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.640
Please justify my client.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:59.860
Free him because there is enough reasonable doubt in him.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:08.670
From a legal point of view, my client did not rape her. From a moral point of view, he is guilty.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:13.520
I object. This is a conviction. The court obeys the law, not morality.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.080
I accept. Do not write down the last words of the defense.

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.520
My statement ends.

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:37.140
Mao Shichen. Before the decision, you must thank the two lawyers for the case.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:45.300
The explanation of the accusation was short. At the same time, the defense does not seek compensation and saves time in court.

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:55.310
The defendant finds you innocent. The case does not suffer a complaint. The accused is free.

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:58.160
And are you ready?

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.720
Thank you, Mr. Loon.

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:21.650
Use violence in court.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:24.080
In the best case, the court will judge you.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:24.520
I know.

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:25.630
Then why?

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.510
Are you my boss or my assistant?

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:29.960
Assistant, appointed by...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.860
Hello, what are you doing?

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:32.970
I'm going to work.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:34.030
I'm a victim of a woman.

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:34.750
And then?

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:35.900
I'm having lunch.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:36.820
Me too.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:37.900
Let's have lunch together.

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:38.970
Is it possible?

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:40.560
Of course it is.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:43.060
Come on in at 12 o'clock.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:43.360
Bye.

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:46.250
Come on.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.400
What were we talking about?

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:50.950
I was just saying that I'm appointed by your boss.

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:52.050
Yes.

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:54.530
We shouldn't be discussing this right here.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:55.940
Hello.

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:56.440
Hello.

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:57.440
Where are you going?

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.080
The toilet.

00:06:58.440 --> 00:06:58.640
And then?

00:06:58.940 --> 00:06:59.220
Out.

00:06:59.220 --> 00:06:59.240
Thank you.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.260
I'll tell you later.

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:01.320
Coffee?

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:02.060
Okay.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:03.500
It's been a long time.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:04.680
You rarely come here.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:05.040
Yes.

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:05.740
See you later.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:06.020
Bye.

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:08.900
What a mess.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:11.470
Come on, let's go.

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:15.700
Boss.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:18.430
Miss.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.170
Did you think about it?

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:23.670
What did you decide?

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:26.700
I don't want compensation.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.340
Close the factory.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.460
If you don't clean it properly,

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:34.860
if your dirty waters are poured into my lake,

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:36.710
my fish will die.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.680
How much does the lake cost?

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:39.400
I'll buy it.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:40.640
It's not for sale.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:41.850
Is that clear?

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.230
You don't sound like a good businessman.

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:47.090
Even business has ethics.

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:49.120
You can't pollute nature.

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:54.960
I don't understand you, Miss Ye.

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.180
I'm only interested in business.

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:58.600
Nothing else.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:04.100
Nothing. Show me the bill for the damages and I'll pay you.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:06.320
The factory can't stop working.

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:07.180
How much does it cost?

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:08.240
I'll buy it.

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:10.180
I'm running out of stories.

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:14.020
Then I'll ask for a ban from the court.

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:21.760
I'll see you in court.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.090
Boss, shall we beat him up?

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:36.090
Okay. Find me a lawyer. I'll take him to court.

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:38.450
The case will go on forever.

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.650
They will never close my factory.

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:45.110
Thank you.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.290
Lawyer Nguyen, hello.

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:49.930
I haven't seen you in a while.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:50.810
I wasn't in Hong Kong.

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:56.180
Let me introduce you. This is Mrs. Nguyen, a professor of geography and ecology.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:58.460
She is the main witness in the case.

00:08:58.820 --> 00:08:59.780
How are you?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.340
This is lawyer Loon. He will lead the defense.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:03.100
How are you?

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:03.400
Good.

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:07.440
Mr. Loon, let's get to the point.

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:10.720
Here are the money.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.480
Can we arrange it outside the court?

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.320
Yes, if the factory stops.

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.010
And for good cleaning.

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:21.910
The client will not pay, but refuses to stop it.

00:09:22.030 --> 00:09:23.810
My client would pay to stop it.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.500
How much do you want?

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:28.050
Okay, our positions are clear.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:29.190
That's right.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:34.060
And to win and to lose, they always pay us.

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:39.380
Miss, how do you determine the quality of the water?

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:42.000
According to the World Health Standards.

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:43.770
English is difficult.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:48.130
I have worked abroad, I am familiar with the subject.

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:53.560
Okay, let's have lunch together, shall we? You will tell me there.

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:57.300
I have already given you all the data.

00:09:59.050 --> 00:09:59.610
Okay.

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:02.930
That's all. I have work to do in court.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:07.850
I understand. Let's have tea when you have time.

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:09.700
Okay. Goodbye.

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:11.090
I'll send it.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:12.090
Thank you.

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:16.850
I'll give you one more thing if you leave on time.

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:23.990
Miss Wen, where are you going?

00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:24.800
To the library.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:25.500
And then?

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:26.950
I'll have lunch.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:28.930
Me too. Let's have lunch together.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:30.960
No.

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:32.120
Why not?

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.380
I like to eat alone.

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:34.880
I like it too.

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:36.800
Yes, I hate the boring company.

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:38.580
Let's go have sushi.

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:40.200
No.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:40.920
Korean.

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.600
I'm sorry, I won't have lunch with you.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.380
Just one lunch.

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:49.290
Yes, just lunch.

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:55.940
Look, they said no later.

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:59.060
How do you feel now?

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:02.060
There was a woman who didn't like you.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:15.520
These weapons are powerful.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:16.480
Look at this.

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:18.140
They use it in the police.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:19.460
It costs 700.

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:26.090
This .45 caliber Colt is probably familiar to you.

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:26.870
1200.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:28.040
Okay.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.150
M17. The most modern machine.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:37.120
With a huge fuel tank. Even two.

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:39.460
You'll scare the police with it.

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:40.650
Are they real?

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:41.950
No, no, no.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:49.030
But they sound and look exactly the same.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:50.650
We'll take them all.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:54.420
Good choice. 70,000 with the discount.

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:57.910
We'll pay them soon.

00:11:58.920 --> 00:11:59.460
Sorry.

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:01.530
In numbers, no credit.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:04.060
Hey, send us Mr. Chan.

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:07.190
I didn't even give him a break for those grenades.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.930
Were we going to steal if we had money?

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:13.230
You can't do it without money.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:20.320
But here, $15 for the piece.

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:22.490
Two for one, look at them.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.600
Merchant, don't you know what kind of people we are?

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:37.100
I'm not a fool!

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:38.660
I'm not a fool!

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.500
Do you know what I used to do?

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:47.290
Teacher of Kung Fu!

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:04.870
Hello?

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.400
What are you doing, Luke?

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.670
Now? I got into a fight.

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:09.070
What?

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:12.640
Here, in our place, in half an hour.

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:13.890
Why? What is it?

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.620
I'll tell you. I have news.

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:18.000
Are you sure?

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:21.240
This lake costs 10 million.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:24.080
15% commission is a lot.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:25.780
That's right, but it's not easy money.

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:27.700
Otherwise it would be boring.

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:35.940
Get out! Get out! Get out of here!

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:36.420
No!

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:41.310
If he sees you again, you will be in trouble.

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:43.280
The lake is not for sale, is that clear?

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:47.450
Will you take it?

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:50.230
Of course. Let's get out of here.

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:47.700
Hey!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:50.910
Hassan!

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:51.210
Jackie!

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:52.640
Nadei!

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:53.200
Hassan!

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.880
Which man?

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:02.440
Don't you see me?

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:03.120
No.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:07.310
Wait, it's me, Jackie.

00:15:07.830 --> 00:15:08.290
Let go of me.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:09.770
Do you see me now?

00:15:09.770 --> 00:15:10.700
I'm Jackie.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.460
Yes, Jackie, didn't I tell you?

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:12.940
Wait.

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:16.270
Here, look.

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:17.410
Jackie.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:18.570
I saw me later.

00:15:18.590 --> 00:15:19.510
I told you it was me.

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:21.870
What are you doing?

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:23.570
What is there?

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:24.790
I saw a thief.

00:15:26.380 --> 00:15:27.180
That was me.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:29.940
What are you doing?

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.440
I'm looking for the lamp key.

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:32.460
Are you blind?

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:34.270
Here.

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:35.050
Coffee?

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:01.360
Why are you here?

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:07.630
Because I need your help for a hearing.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:09.290
That's why.

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:12.400
Oh, your aquarium. Did you make it?

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:16.370
Hey, don't put sugar.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.370
So you will ruin my nice cafe.

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:20.720
Heard?

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:22.640
Okay.

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:27.050
What did he say? What did he say?

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:31.290
I need help.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:33.110
The last one.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.480
Oh, you asked about the aquarium.

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:38.320
The fish is like life.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.240
It moves forward.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:41.460
It doesn't turn.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:44.900
Why are you here?

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:46.760
To help me with listening.

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:47.800
Okay.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:52.790
The birds are a symbol of capitalism.

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:55.580
The fish are a symbol of communism.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:58.890
Two different doctrines.

00:16:58.970 --> 00:16:59.880
Got it?

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:03.360
No, I just know that you are killing them.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:04.260
Why are you here?

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:06.300
To help me with the interrogation.

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:10.180
The interrogation is not moral.

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:11.180
Not at all.

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:17.920
It's better if I put a knife in his throat and he will tell us everything.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:22.550
Good idea, but don't do anything.

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:24.720
Just forget it.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:26.450
I can't.

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.190
We are friends.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.260
I promise I'll help you.

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:32.740
So, why are you here?

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:35.290
Tell me, why are you here?

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:41.110
I want you to help me with listening.

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:44.400
Seriously? Tell me.

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:45.740
Seriously.

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:50.570
It looks like life has messed up your brain.

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:51.800
Yes, yes.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:16.640
Come on.

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:17.550
It's me.

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:18.890
And why are you in my house?

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:20.720
Your house?

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:21.840
Where do you live?

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.680
Block A, number 9.

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:26.220
This is Block B. Block A is there.

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:34.090
I'm sorry. It's my fault. I'm leaving.

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:37.850
But you are...

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.850
Sorry, I'm new here. I'll be more careful.

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:43.280
Are you okay?

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:43.920
Yes.

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:46.480
Let me help you with the luggage.

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:47.920
Thank you.

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:02.430
Thank you for everything.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.410
You're welcome. We're neighbors.

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:11.560
Stay. Have some tea.

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:13.080
I can't. No.

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:14.600
No?

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:16.860
Goodbye.

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:17.550
Bye.

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.960
Well, we're friends now.

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:28.390
One day we might become more than friends.

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:41.800
Are you sure we can't solve it outside the court?

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:45.520
If we could do it, I wouldn't want a fine.

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:48.420
The lawyers are unpleasant.

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:50.120
Have you found anything new?

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.720
The lawyer invited me for dinner.

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:58.080
Nothing new? Why didn't he invite me?

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.780
Brother, don't underestimate yourself.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:04.310
I don't. But I'm not stupid.

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:07.440
I used to be beautiful, but I'm not young anymore.

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:11.560
Listen to me. We're brothers, aren't we?

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.510
You need to find yourself a friend. Don't be capricious.

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:16.820
I don't have a choice anymore.

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:21.370
Any healthy and smart enough man is perfect for me.

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:25.580
Even if he's unemployed. Even if he's poor and irresponsible.

00:20:26.590 --> 00:20:27.930
Yeah, she's not capricious.

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:29.220
Would you like any?

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.300
Yes, so that there is no scum.

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:46.780
Get out of the way!

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:48.740
Be strict!

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:51.560
Stay calm!

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:55.480
Don't stop moving!

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.350
Wait, wait. Are you going to have lunch with him?

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:16.580
Why didn't you say yes?

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:17.600
Why should I?

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:21.630
So we can figure out what tricks he's using, right?

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:37.460
Thank you.

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:05.150
Rebecca, help me!

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:20.680
You'll get wet!

00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:26.390
Thief! Don't move! I got you!

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:37.460
Come back! You can't get away from me! You won't get away from me!

00:22:38.900 --> 00:22:41.670
Come on!

00:22:43.900 --> 00:22:45.580
I'm trying to get this thief!

00:22:46.270 --> 00:22:48.200
Thief? Call the police!

00:22:56.380 --> 00:22:58.460
Good job! We got him!

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:03.930
This is Mr. Wong, our new neighbor.

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:04.410
Yes.

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:05.620
Thank you.

00:23:05.840 --> 00:23:07.220
You're welcome.

00:23:07.520 --> 00:23:09.210
The neighbors need to help themselves.

00:23:09.390 --> 00:23:21.440
Good for you.

00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:22.080
What happened?

00:23:22.780 --> 00:23:23.160
You're free.

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:24.300
Come on.

00:23:24.440 --> 00:23:29.820
Did you go to jail?

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:33.730
I don't want to. I can't even breathe in there. Help me.

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:34.390
Don't worry.

00:23:34.870 --> 00:23:37.580
Hey, you don't intend to leave me, do you?

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:50.100
Stop it, Timati. Hey, take the elevator.

00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:53.760
The elevator? I can't. I have a terrible claustrophobia.

00:23:54.350 --> 00:23:58.500
Then, the pillars. Go. I'll go through you later to see you.

00:24:04.570 --> 00:24:05.190
Hello.

00:24:05.970 --> 00:24:09.840
What a coincidence. Mr. Loon is protecting the factory.

00:24:10.280 --> 00:24:10.580
Smile.

00:24:13.080 --> 00:24:15.180
Oh, Hula's lawyer.

00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:16.340
The lake is on my desk.

00:24:18.050 --> 00:24:18.970
Nice to meet you.

00:24:19.430 --> 00:24:20.710
We'll meet in the yard.

00:24:21.170 --> 00:24:23.440
And then we'll meet in court.

00:24:24.550 --> 00:24:24.770
Yes.

00:24:26.550 --> 00:24:29.610
Miss, I was wondering...

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:31.280
Are you inviting her for lunch?

00:24:31.590 --> 00:24:32.930
Yes, if possible.

00:24:33.290 --> 00:24:34.090
Who are you inviting?

00:24:34.310 --> 00:24:36.220
It's better if you look at her.

00:24:36.420 --> 00:24:40.560
I can't.

00:24:42.690 --> 00:24:43.170
Dinner?

00:24:44.340 --> 00:24:44.740
Wonderful.

00:24:45.500 --> 00:24:46.540
Give me your number.

00:24:47.840 --> 00:24:50.120
I'll call you later to pick you up.

00:24:53.660 --> 00:24:54.360
I'm listening.

00:24:55.820 --> 00:24:57.270
Here's her business card.

00:25:10.520 --> 00:25:11.000
Thank you.

00:25:12.120 --> 00:25:14.480
No, no, this sofa is much more comfortable.

00:25:14.720 --> 00:25:18.240
Sit here.

00:25:18.460 --> 00:25:23.320
This is the most comfortable place in the house.

00:25:23.660 --> 00:25:26.370
There is no need, I feel good here.

00:25:26.700 --> 00:25:27.060
Is that so?

00:25:27.160 --> 00:25:28.500
It is possible.

00:25:29.440 --> 00:25:29.860
Excuse me.

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:41.440
Yes, hello. I wasn't sitting here.

00:25:42.540 --> 00:25:43.220
Let's have a drink.

00:25:43.950 --> 00:25:44.330
Okay.

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:01.220
Have you put something in my wine?

00:26:01.620 --> 00:26:02.000
Please?

00:26:02.160 --> 00:26:04.340
I feel drunk.

00:26:04.600 --> 00:26:06.340
It hasn't reached the stomach yet.

00:26:06.970 --> 00:26:08.190
But it has reached the head.

00:26:09.460 --> 00:26:11.460
I don't know what happened to me.

00:26:11.480 --> 00:26:16.020
Look, look, I have a fever.

00:26:16.910 --> 00:26:17.550
You don't.

00:26:17.650 --> 00:26:21.430
Oh, maybe I'm just pretending that I'm sick.

00:26:22.680 --> 00:26:24.480
There's barely anything in common with the wine.

00:26:28.810 --> 00:26:29.270
Hello?

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:30.180
Hello?

00:26:30.260 --> 00:26:30.920
It's Timati.

00:26:31.040 --> 00:26:31.660
What do you want?

00:26:31.920 --> 00:26:32.380
I'm here.

00:26:32.680 --> 00:26:33.000
Where?

00:26:33.460 --> 00:26:34.540
In your room.

00:26:34.960 --> 00:26:39.120
Oh, don't move. If you don't feel good, I'll pass later.

00:26:39.200 --> 00:26:44.830
What did we talk about?

00:26:50.140 --> 00:26:50.540
Hello?

00:26:50.890 --> 00:26:52.210
If you don't come, I'll come.

00:26:52.670 --> 00:26:55.480
No, no. I'm coming now.

00:26:56.300 --> 00:26:56.700
Goodbye.

00:27:00.800 --> 00:27:03.650
I remembered something. I'll be right back.

00:27:05.970 --> 00:27:06.790
Excuse me.

00:27:06.890 --> 00:27:15.540
Hey, come in.

00:27:15.680 --> 00:27:16.540
Through the window.

00:27:16.840 --> 00:27:17.000
Quiet!

00:27:17.420 --> 00:27:18.180
I have a question.

00:27:18.670 --> 00:27:19.790
Answer me.

00:27:19.910 --> 00:27:20.850
What is it?

00:27:21.110 --> 00:27:22.570
What a nice man like me.

00:27:22.690 --> 00:27:24.930
Such a faithful friend and a true Samaritan.

00:27:25.150 --> 00:27:29.870
We can give him a job, but he still has to be discreet and not satisfied with life.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:32.640
Okay, I'll try again.

00:27:33.000 --> 00:27:35.840
Jackie? Jackie?

00:27:36.480 --> 00:27:37.560
On the phone.

00:27:38.210 --> 00:27:41.110
Coming. I'll call you later.

00:27:41.770 --> 00:27:42.550
You stay here.

00:27:44.840 --> 00:27:47.080
That's her. Thank you.

00:27:47.790 --> 00:27:50.030
Hello? Jackie? Where are you?

00:27:50.130 --> 00:27:52.160
At home. Hello? Hello?

00:27:54.220 --> 00:27:55.140
What are you looking for?

00:27:56.040 --> 00:27:59.420
I'm coming.

00:28:00.860 --> 00:28:04.380
This is the woman who is judging me.

00:28:04.480 --> 00:28:08.000
You want to kill her, huh? Tell me what's going on here.

00:28:08.120 --> 00:28:11.700
What about my future? What's going on with my future?

00:28:12.040 --> 00:28:14.350
Tell me. Don't answer my question.

00:28:14.670 --> 00:28:16.560
Calm down. Give me one night.

00:28:17.320 --> 00:28:19.810
Then I'm yours and you'll ask me whatever you want.

00:28:20.030 --> 00:28:22.390
Did you hear? Go. Come on. Go.

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:32.000
No, it wasn't in my room.

00:28:32.340 --> 00:28:33.420
I don't know where it is.

00:28:33.880 --> 00:28:34.520
Where's your toilet?

00:28:35.520 --> 00:28:35.960
Toilet?

00:28:36.500 --> 00:28:36.940
Yes.

00:28:37.060 --> 00:28:37.890
Right there.

00:28:48.540 --> 00:28:49.440
There you are.

00:28:49.680 --> 00:28:52.240
You're still putting your keys under the sink, huh?

00:28:52.400 --> 00:28:55.330
They stopped the connection, that's why I came to see you.

00:28:56.050 --> 00:28:59.110
Now I'm a neighbor to the woman from the lake and we're already friends.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:00.500
Neighbors?

00:29:01.240 --> 00:29:03.200
Bad. One of the women is in my house.

00:29:03.440 --> 00:29:03.920
Go away.

00:29:05.870 --> 00:29:06.330
Come on.

00:29:09.180 --> 00:29:10.160
Why did you turn it off?

00:29:10.440 --> 00:29:12.140
Because it's more romantic.

00:29:15.630 --> 00:29:16.830
I love the light.

00:29:17.290 --> 00:29:18.870
Then the little lamp will shine.

00:29:18.950 --> 00:29:27.320
Do you want us to have a party at the lights?

00:29:38.480 --> 00:29:39.080
I'll check.

00:29:47.710 --> 00:29:48.470
What's going on?

00:29:48.590 --> 00:29:50.170
The dog has stolen the lamp.

00:29:50.470 --> 00:29:51.850
This is a porcelain dog.

00:29:52.210 --> 00:29:53.730
Beautiful coat. Where did you get it?

00:29:56.180 --> 00:29:58.120
I took it when I went to Canada.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:02.100
It's beautiful. I'll leave it in the wardrobe.

00:30:02.380 --> 00:30:08.060
Come in.

00:30:08.300 --> 00:30:11.090
Yes, thank you.

00:30:11.310 --> 00:30:11.450
Please.

00:30:30.540 --> 00:30:31.300
I heard something.

00:30:31.740 --> 00:30:35.060
The wood is rotting because of the dry weather. Let's have a taste.

00:30:35.930 --> 00:30:36.270
Thank you.

00:30:36.590 --> 00:30:42.260
The stove is beautiful.

00:30:50.320 --> 00:30:53.720
Wait, I had to change this cabinet last year.

00:30:53.980 --> 00:30:54.940
Now it's broken.

00:30:55.310 --> 00:30:56.810
Let's not miss our dinner.

00:31:16.440 --> 00:31:17.820
I'm the only one with the net, and now my friends!

00:31:18.200 --> 00:31:29.000
Where are we going?

00:31:30.790 --> 00:31:48.050
I forgot to turn off the radio.

00:31:52.250 --> 00:31:53.130
Stop right now!

00:31:53.970 --> 00:31:55.390
Snigoo! Can you hear me?

00:31:55.590 --> 00:31:58.350
Come on!

00:31:58.840 --> 00:31:59.240
Idiot!

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:01.200
What? How dare you?

00:32:01.260 --> 00:32:02.000
He's my friend.

00:32:02.440 --> 00:32:04.700
Friend? I caught him yesterday to steal the net.

00:32:05.100 --> 00:32:06.420
I sent him to listen.

00:32:06.900 --> 00:32:07.640
Are you friends?

00:32:07.960 --> 00:32:08.200
Yes.

00:32:08.340 --> 00:32:08.980
With this?

00:32:09.200 --> 00:32:11.310
So he's your friend, like the girls outside.

00:32:11.530 --> 00:32:14.350
And you made me leave them and then send him to catch me. Why?

00:32:14.590 --> 00:32:15.390
I'm your friend.

00:32:15.690 --> 00:32:16.550
It's a misunderstanding.

00:32:17.570 --> 00:32:18.410
Please, don't fight.

00:32:19.090 --> 00:32:21.640
I'll explain everything to you after I send her.

00:32:22.000 --> 00:32:22.300
Right?

00:32:22.460 --> 00:32:24.260
Hey, look at me.

00:32:25.040 --> 00:32:25.920
Don't fight.

00:32:27.230 --> 00:32:27.950
I won't fight.

00:32:30.030 --> 00:32:30.650
Don't fight.

00:32:30.850 --> 00:32:33.890
Don't fight.

00:32:34.110 --> 00:32:36.580
Here you are.

00:32:36.580 --> 00:32:37.460
Take it.

00:32:43.140 --> 00:32:44.540
Delicious, isn't it?

00:32:44.720 --> 00:32:45.670
Are you full?

00:32:47.060 --> 00:32:48.480
Oh, you don't like meat.

00:32:48.740 --> 00:32:50.260
Next time I'll cook something else.

00:32:50.740 --> 00:32:51.700
It's time for you to go.

00:32:51.960 --> 00:32:52.890
Come on.

00:32:53.050 --> 00:32:53.790
I'm still hungry.

00:32:55.030 --> 00:32:55.450
Come on.

00:32:55.490 --> 00:32:55.750
Bye.

00:32:57.410 --> 00:32:58.230
See you soon.

00:32:58.310 --> 00:32:58.810
I'll call you.

00:33:05.880 --> 00:33:08.170
Enough! Enough of that! Stop it!

00:33:08.470 --> 00:33:23.980
Excuse me, what happened to your eye?

00:33:24.320 --> 00:33:27.190
What? My eye? Nothing. What's wrong?

00:33:27.370 --> 00:33:28.760
I forgot about it.

00:33:29.040 --> 00:33:29.890
Just a moment.

00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:30.740
Bye!

00:33:34.600 --> 00:33:44.990
Are you drunk?

00:33:45.760 --> 00:33:46.140
Yes!

00:33:46.620 --> 00:33:47.520
You are drunk!

00:33:47.780 --> 00:33:48.220
Bye!

00:33:48.470 --> 00:33:48.750
Bye!

00:34:00.960 --> 00:34:01.360
Stop it!

00:34:06.810 --> 00:34:07.610
Promise me.

00:34:19.050 --> 00:34:20.170
What are we going to do?

00:34:20.590 --> 00:34:21.950
Why didn't you tell me you were friends?

00:34:22.170 --> 00:34:22.850
How should I know?

00:34:22.930 --> 00:34:24.370
I tried to marry the woman.

00:34:24.550 --> 00:34:24.950
This is it!

00:34:24.990 --> 00:34:26.280
I will win two million!

00:34:26.890 --> 00:34:27.780
This is it!

00:34:27.780 --> 00:34:28.680
Two million!

00:34:29.000 --> 00:34:29.800
What are you talking about?

00:34:30.030 --> 00:34:31.490
There are more valuable things than that.

00:34:31.630 --> 00:34:31.970
Yes.

00:34:32.190 --> 00:34:33.900
Gold, silver, diamonds.

00:34:34.400 --> 00:34:35.460
I'm talking about love.

00:34:35.800 --> 00:34:36.540
About freedom.

00:34:37.260 --> 00:34:38.540
You're a very stupid man.

00:34:38.860 --> 00:34:39.160
Come on!

00:34:39.380 --> 00:34:40.270
Calm down!

00:34:40.630 --> 00:34:41.410
Don't worry.

00:34:41.670 --> 00:34:43.570
In the worst case,

00:34:43.890 --> 00:34:46.170
I'll make them withdraw the accusation.

00:34:46.290 --> 00:34:46.950
And that's it.

00:34:47.170 --> 00:34:48.010
Are you crazy?

00:34:48.430 --> 00:34:51.260
And if you're crazy enough to leave here

00:34:51.260 --> 00:34:52.220
with a hole in your head?

00:34:53.140 --> 00:34:53.480
Hey!

00:34:54.470 --> 00:34:56.630
They'll arrest you for indecent behavior.

00:34:57.400 --> 00:34:57.820
I don't care.

00:34:58.200 --> 00:34:58.500
No.

00:34:59.040 --> 00:34:59.300
Here.

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:05.100
Look around. It's full of rascals, punks and crooks.

00:35:05.820 --> 00:35:08.690
It's hard to live today. It's not like it was once.

00:35:09.090 --> 00:35:11.010
And the worst thing is that they are terrible.

00:35:12.990 --> 00:35:13.690
I'm sorry.

00:35:14.420 --> 00:35:15.660
Why did you eat this guy?

00:35:15.720 --> 00:35:15.980
Shut up.

00:35:16.380 --> 00:35:17.160
Don't mess with me.

00:35:17.720 --> 00:35:18.720
What do you want to say?

00:35:19.170 --> 00:35:19.570
Nothing.

00:35:20.430 --> 00:35:21.750
Don't talk nonsense. Is that clear?

00:35:22.200 --> 00:35:26.470
Okay, okay. Calm down. It wasn't like that before.

00:35:27.480 --> 00:35:29.020
Why have you changed so much?

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:32.880
Life is thoughtless if there is no change in it.

00:35:33.640 --> 00:35:35.080
Thoughtless, like his words.

00:35:35.650 --> 00:35:37.540
Hey, calm down.

00:35:38.110 --> 00:35:38.730
Let's drink.

00:35:39.030 --> 00:35:39.760
You too?

00:35:40.890 --> 00:35:41.510
Here you go.

00:35:43.240 --> 00:35:44.620
From here, Mr. Hua.

00:35:45.120 --> 00:35:45.800
Thank you.

00:35:50.280 --> 00:35:50.960
Don't worry.

00:35:51.380 --> 00:35:52.340
Jackie, hello.

00:35:53.090 --> 00:35:54.490
I'm Mr. Hua.

00:35:54.670 --> 00:35:56.790
Let me introduce you to Haide Lastman.

00:35:57.150 --> 00:35:58.520
Okay, let's go.

00:35:58.600 --> 00:35:59.320
Come with me in a second.

00:35:59.580 --> 00:35:59.900
Come.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:01.280
Come on, wait for me.

00:36:03.740 --> 00:36:06.240
Okay, you're the last man, you too.

00:36:06.520 --> 00:36:07.020
Come on.

00:36:11.440 --> 00:36:14.580
Mr. Hua, let me introduce you to the lawyer Jackie Loon.

00:36:14.720 --> 00:36:15.500
He leads your case.

00:36:16.380 --> 00:36:18.880
Oh, wonderful. Okay.

00:36:19.260 --> 00:36:20.220
Nice to meet you.

00:36:20.340 --> 00:36:22.540
I count on you to save my factory.

00:36:23.180 --> 00:36:23.790
I try.

00:36:24.600 --> 00:36:26.220
They both help me with the case.

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:31.680
Nice to meet you, Mr. Hoa.

00:36:32.820 --> 00:36:36.760
Mr. Hoa, this is Jackie. Your case is in the right hands.

00:36:37.770 --> 00:36:38.210
Wonderful.

00:36:38.770 --> 00:36:40.310
Would you like something to drink?

00:36:40.750 --> 00:36:41.190
Yes.

00:36:41.510 --> 00:36:43.690
We are still collecting evidence against the enemy.

00:36:44.110 --> 00:36:44.770
Something is wrong.

00:36:45.110 --> 00:36:57.030
You dare to attack me so badly?

00:37:02.080 --> 00:37:04.060
Get up! Get up!

00:37:09.570 --> 00:37:29.620
What are you doing?

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:30.240
at that

00:38:03.080 --> 00:38:04.690
Let me go!

00:38:04.750 --> 00:38:05.570
Stay here.

00:38:08.300 --> 00:38:11.530
I'm sorry. I didn't want to get you into trouble.

00:38:12.150 --> 00:38:15.280
I was done if it wasn't for the three of you.

00:38:15.580 --> 00:38:18.290
Tooth and knee from violence. That's why you have bad luck.

00:38:18.820 --> 00:38:23.360
He's following you. He's not waiting for you. See you soon.

00:38:23.700 --> 00:38:23.840
Hey!

00:38:23.980 --> 00:38:27.530
Wait, wait. I'm sorry. Malko is drunk.

00:38:28.860 --> 00:38:29.220
It's okay.

00:38:30.030 --> 00:38:33.010
The three of you kill, and that's enough.

00:38:33.890 --> 00:38:36.530
Good that you work for me, otherwise...

00:38:39.010 --> 00:38:41.950
How can you be so weak? I'm ashamed of you.

00:38:42.810 --> 00:38:44.610
Boss, we didn't know about those three.

00:38:44.990 --> 00:38:48.800
Hey, they were three. Kill the lawyer.

00:38:49.800 --> 00:38:51.480
There's nothing special about him.

00:38:52.110 --> 00:38:54.240
Nothing? He's dangerous.

00:38:54.980 --> 00:38:56.940
Does he need to write killer on his forehead?

00:39:03.840 --> 00:39:04.800
What a beautiful box!

00:39:05.500 --> 00:39:06.880
There are more beautiful ones.

00:39:16.480 --> 00:39:16.820
Hello?

00:39:16.960 --> 00:39:17.340
Come on.

00:39:26.720 --> 00:39:27.260
Okay, let's go.

00:39:45.680 --> 00:39:47.440
Mr. Loon, Mrs. Loon.

00:39:47.500 --> 00:39:49.400
Hey, do you like it?

00:39:50.780 --> 00:39:52.260
Yes, but you're exaggerating.

00:39:52.560 --> 00:39:57.420
No, on the contrary, we ourselves had dinner for a little variety, right?

00:40:00.800 --> 00:40:06.070
Wow! Jackie, look! Do you always have lunch like this?

00:40:06.540 --> 00:40:07.800
I have enough to have lunch with you.

00:40:17.180 --> 00:40:18.300
There are a lot of people.

00:40:18.540 --> 00:40:19.600
May I serve?

00:40:20.080 --> 00:40:21.490
It's probably terribly expensive.

00:40:22.050 --> 00:40:23.210
I'll pay for lunch.

00:40:23.530 --> 00:40:25.790
I have to somehow make a profit for that day.

00:40:26.410 --> 00:40:29.230
If I were ready, you would save a lot.

00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:30.480
It wasn't much.

00:40:30.680 --> 00:40:31.920
How are you?

00:40:45.560 --> 00:40:46.900
Excuse me for a moment.

00:40:47.800 --> 00:40:49.020
I'm going to the toilet.

00:40:49.320 --> 00:40:49.580
Yes.

00:40:53.290 --> 00:40:55.860
Miss, the ship is only yours.

00:40:56.080 --> 00:40:57.750
Shall we take you to the men's room?

00:40:59.090 --> 00:40:59.470
No.

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:00.880
Okay, let's do it.

00:41:01.180 --> 00:41:17.340
Please, up! Faster!

00:41:41.160 --> 00:41:42.290
What did you do?

00:41:42.890 --> 00:41:47.620
I'm gonna kill you!

00:41:47.820 --> 00:41:50.550
What did you do?

00:42:03.480 --> 00:42:04.040
Get out, now!

00:43:30.440 --> 00:43:30.600
No!

00:43:45.280 --> 00:43:57.390
Jackie, Jackie, what's wrong?

00:44:00.060 --> 00:44:01.460
The winner has no clue.

00:44:01.820 --> 00:44:02.080
What?

00:44:03.770 --> 00:44:04.550
Come on.

00:44:29.280 --> 00:44:29.880
Sweetie.

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:36.440
It's her. Mrs. Ye. Here you go.

00:44:39.260 --> 00:44:40.020
What is it?

00:44:41.170 --> 00:44:42.910
I want a reward.

00:44:45.220 --> 00:44:46.360
Take a flower.

00:44:47.180 --> 00:44:48.860
I prefer to spend an evening with you.

00:44:50.130 --> 00:44:50.990
Let's have dinner.

00:44:51.290 --> 00:44:52.630
Let's talk all night.

00:44:52.890 --> 00:44:53.930
We're neighbors now.

00:44:54.370 --> 00:44:55.510
Let's be friends.

00:44:55.850 --> 00:44:56.510
What do you say?

00:44:57.310 --> 00:44:58.330
Friends are naughty.

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:02.260
That's why... I don't have much.

00:45:03.000 --> 00:45:04.040
You're risking your sister.

00:45:04.440 --> 00:45:06.120
Your eyes say otherwise.

00:45:06.590 --> 00:45:07.250
You're not honest.

00:45:07.630 --> 00:45:08.940
I can read it.

00:45:09.140 --> 00:45:11.120
They say you're a womanizer.

00:45:13.260 --> 00:45:14.780
I'm not a womanizer anymore.

00:45:15.320 --> 00:45:16.240
Believe me.

00:45:16.560 --> 00:45:17.410
Not my eyes.

00:45:17.730 --> 00:45:19.350
I believe in one man.

00:45:20.840 --> 00:45:21.960
I'm... different.

00:45:22.910 --> 00:45:23.430
Honestly.

00:45:23.770 --> 00:45:28.100
Thank you for the invitation, but I have to go.

00:45:28.360 --> 00:45:28.660
Bye.

00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:32.800
Don't give up. Let's eat. Aren't you hungry?

00:45:33.200 --> 00:45:39.130
Let me go. You're the man. I know you well. You're all the same.

00:45:40.310 --> 00:45:46.120
Yes, I admit I'm a man, but I'm different. I'll wait for you in the Red Dragon.

00:45:46.320 --> 00:45:47.400
I can't.

00:45:47.540 --> 00:45:50.930
I'll wait for you. Did you hear?

00:45:51.310 --> 00:45:52.450
I won't come.

00:45:54.670 --> 00:45:58.840
Come on. I'll be there. I'll be standing here until you come.

00:45:59.120 --> 00:45:59.980
I told you to wait.

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:02.000
Vinyama

00:46:30.410 --> 00:46:32.460
He was serious.

00:46:33.020 --> 00:46:41.350
He has to get married.

00:46:41.710 --> 00:46:42.930
Me too, sir.

00:46:43.690 --> 00:46:44.530
Well, get married.

00:46:48.470 --> 00:46:50.190
You won't stay long.

00:46:50.490 --> 00:46:57.760
Only one man deserves trust.

00:47:01.500 --> 00:47:02.320
Why not?

00:47:04.790 --> 00:47:06.370
Come on, look to the right.

00:47:06.610 --> 00:47:11.890
You said no, but you are here and, despite that, you do not enter the restaurant.

00:47:12.190 --> 00:47:23.900
Do you dare?

00:47:24.220 --> 00:47:25.680
I will follow you.

00:47:25.840 --> 00:47:29.200
The actions are stronger than the strongest words.

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:30.920
Here I am. Here I am.

00:47:31.060 --> 00:47:34.950
I know you wanted to see if I was really serious.

00:47:35.330 --> 00:47:36.990
You saw that I was serious.

00:47:37.190 --> 00:47:39.770
If you don't believe me, listen to yourself.

00:47:40.720 --> 00:47:42.020
You can see that we like each other.

00:47:45.690 --> 00:47:48.470
Miss, don't look at me like that. I'm not talking to you.

00:47:49.700 --> 00:47:51.060
I'm talking to the woman behind you.

00:47:55.830 --> 00:47:58.790
Don't walk so fast with your black leather coat.

00:48:02.140 --> 00:48:05.970
Love doesn't move fast. Give your feelings a chance.

00:48:06.520 --> 00:48:08.420
Two souls are needed for something to happen.

00:48:08.560 --> 00:48:15.560
The lady with the gray scarf. Stop and think about my words.

00:48:16.330 --> 00:48:20.360
I'm not talking nonsense. New friends aren't such a bad thing.

00:48:20.700 --> 00:48:27.290
Did you make it?

00:48:32.560 --> 00:48:40.420
I'm sorry. I went too far. There was no other way. You didn't leave me a choice.

00:48:44.920 --> 00:48:50.190
You're a complete idiot. To speak in front of everyone. Very clever.

00:48:52.890 --> 00:48:53.690
Where are we going to have dinner?

00:48:55.530 --> 00:48:56.330
It doesn't matter.

00:48:58.820 --> 00:48:59.660
Excuse us!

00:49:00.476 --> 00:49:01.236
Let's go!

00:49:01.596 --> 00:49:04.596
We are going to dinner, excuse me, excuse me.

00:49:05.052 --> 00:49:06.052
Get out of here!

00:49:20.668 --> 00:49:22.668
Thank you for watching!

00:50:03.580 --> 00:50:03.880
I'll see you next time.

00:50:36.910 --> 00:50:40.220
You came out with me, just to win the case, right?

00:50:41.400 --> 00:50:43.880
Leila, didn't you do the same?

00:50:46.780 --> 00:50:49.490
You see, victory doesn't matter.

00:50:49.850 --> 00:50:50.720
Neither does the loss.

00:50:52.050 --> 00:50:53.110
They always pay me.

00:50:54.250 --> 00:50:56.940
But a girl like you is rarely seen.

00:50:57.040 --> 00:50:59.840
And maybe she's already married.

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:05.760
The same goes for the men. Most of the famous men are already married.

00:51:09.160 --> 00:51:11.440
Don't get on my nerves. You're not famous.

00:51:12.220 --> 00:51:13.200
Because I'm not married?

00:51:18.600 --> 00:51:20.420
Are you okay?

00:51:21.670 --> 00:51:23.450
You don't need to use force.

00:51:24.810 --> 00:51:26.430
What are we going to do? Tell me.

00:51:28.050 --> 00:51:29.910
I don't know. What am I supposed to do?

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:30.820
Sorry.

00:51:36.670 --> 00:51:37.630
Hit me again.

00:51:38.100 --> 00:51:38.580
Come on.

00:51:39.060 --> 00:51:40.200
Hit me on the head.

00:51:40.480 --> 00:51:42.310
Come on.

00:51:42.550 --> 00:51:52.630
I caught only one fish.

00:51:52.830 --> 00:51:53.710
It doesn't bite me.

00:51:53.930 --> 00:51:58.820
The pleasure is not catching the fish.

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:07.340
No, calmness. Do you feel it? It's unique.

00:52:09.590 --> 00:52:12.130
Why do fish have so many fins?

00:52:13.920 --> 00:52:15.880
Stop it or I'll eat myself.

00:52:30.320 --> 00:52:32.660
Have you ever thought about selling the lake?

00:52:32.900 --> 00:52:33.120
Why?

00:52:33.440 --> 00:52:38.540
Sell it. We'll move in. We'll make a ranch.

00:52:39.000 --> 00:52:42.780
We'll watch cows, cuckoos. Think about it.

00:52:43.470 --> 00:52:45.230
We'll walk around all day.

00:52:46.360 --> 00:52:47.820
We'll ride in the nature.

00:52:48.160 --> 00:52:52.260
Oh, this bright horizon.

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:03.120
A short, sweet, long day

00:53:03.830 --> 00:53:06.770
That's a long, sweet, long day

00:53:06.770 --> 00:53:13.200
A long, long, long day

00:53:13.990 --> 00:53:16.250
That's a long, sweet, long day

00:53:16.250 --> 00:53:19.440
You're not even suggesting it to me?

00:53:19.460 --> 00:53:24.650
Well, keep your head down.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:31.040
I have a secret.

00:53:31.240 --> 00:53:31.920
Tell me.

00:53:33.280 --> 00:53:39.590
In your will, my father promised to write down the lake on your back.

00:53:42.860 --> 00:53:44.620
Luke, what is it?

00:53:46.740 --> 00:53:51.480
The secret you have given me, I trust a lot.

00:53:53.580 --> 00:53:56.040
Why? It is my secret.

00:53:57.680 --> 00:53:58.740
I am an honest man.

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:02.920
I don't know if I can keep it. That's why it's so heavy.

00:54:05.130 --> 00:54:06.710
Take it as your own.

00:54:07.030 --> 00:54:07.750
As my own?

00:54:08.400 --> 00:54:13.590
Are you better?

00:54:14.110 --> 00:54:21.660
Yes. Now it's different. The secret is mine.

00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:30.560
I'm getting old.

00:55:02.460 --> 00:55:02.940
Here you go.

00:55:07.200 --> 00:55:08.760
You got lost, didn't you?

00:55:09.340 --> 00:55:09.920
Come on!

00:55:10.640 --> 00:55:15.900
Don't worry, it's okay.

00:55:16.280 --> 00:55:16.980
It's my turn.

00:55:17.800 --> 00:55:19.780
Wait, check what's going on.

00:55:20.420 --> 00:55:22.140
Isn't the light much more beautiful in the moonlight?

00:55:22.800 --> 00:55:26.800
No, no. The food is going to fall apart and we're going to have to throw out the soup,

00:55:27.470 --> 00:55:29.610
the rice and the food on the stove.

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:31.320
Go check it out.

00:55:31.980 --> 00:55:34.200
Why are you walking around, Tom? I don't understand the electricity.

00:55:34.800 --> 00:55:41.080
The bush is burned.

00:55:41.460 --> 00:55:55.280
Who are you?

00:56:00.280 --> 00:56:00.720
Jackie?

00:56:01.000 --> 00:56:01.440
Yes?

00:56:04.210 --> 00:56:12.880
Jackie, what is it?

00:56:13.000 --> 00:56:15.860
There is a strange man inside.

00:56:15.860 --> 00:56:16.660
And now?

00:56:16.900 --> 00:56:20.750
Go to the middle of the room, count to three and light it.

00:56:20.890 --> 00:56:21.640
Got it?

00:56:21.720 --> 00:56:23.570
Come on, faster!

00:56:33.680 --> 00:56:35.680
Wait, it's done. What now?

00:56:36.270 --> 00:56:36.910
Be careful!

00:56:37.590 --> 00:56:55.820
F**k you! Are you crazy?

00:56:56.280 --> 00:56:56.800
I'm not!

00:56:56.920 --> 00:56:58.080
What are you doing?

00:56:59.080 --> 00:56:59.860
Killing all the kids!

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:07.860
Let me go! Let me go! Let me go!

00:57:07.860 --> 00:57:10.820
Let me go!

00:57:11.140 --> 00:57:11.820
What's going on?

00:57:11.980 --> 00:57:12.680
No, it's your job.

00:57:13.220 --> 00:57:14.260
You don't behave like an idiot.

00:57:14.480 --> 00:57:15.580
Am I an idiot?

00:57:15.940 --> 00:57:17.140
You're lying to your wife, right?

00:57:19.160 --> 00:57:20.600
What are you talking about?

00:57:21.470 --> 00:57:22.070
I don't know.

00:57:22.690 --> 00:57:23.090
Nonsense!

00:57:26.620 --> 00:57:27.660
Enough! Enough! Enough!

00:57:29.000 --> 00:57:29.880
Listen to me!

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:31.230
Don't do it!

00:57:31.380 --> 00:57:32.040
Shut up!

00:57:32.620 --> 00:57:34.160
You're the one who should shut up!

00:57:34.240 --> 00:57:38.420
You made me listen to them, and when they caught me, you left me all alone!

00:57:38.820 --> 00:57:40.230
Did you listen to us?

00:57:40.950 --> 00:57:41.690
Don't believe him!

00:57:42.220 --> 00:57:42.900
He's crazy!

00:57:45.300 --> 00:57:45.960
Wait, wait!

00:57:46.740 --> 00:57:49.180
Things aren't as complicated as they look!

00:57:49.420 --> 00:57:50.120
Yes, they are simple!

00:57:50.540 --> 00:57:51.650
They really are simple!

00:57:52.830 --> 00:57:53.370
Get lost!

00:57:53.790 --> 00:57:59.040
And listen to me!

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:00.980
I'll listen to you in court.

00:58:02.070 --> 00:58:02.510
Wait!

00:58:04.190 --> 00:58:04.630
Rebecca!

00:58:05.830 --> 00:58:06.270
Wait!

00:58:09.740 --> 00:58:10.720
You failed everything.

00:58:11.060 --> 00:58:14.060
I'm not guilty. We failed when he caught me.

00:58:14.740 --> 00:58:16.520
Didn't I tell you? It was a coincidence.

00:58:16.840 --> 00:58:18.510
I saw that it didn't happen for nothing.

00:58:19.250 --> 00:58:20.110
How did you do it?

00:58:20.610 --> 00:58:22.910
You don't believe me, do you?

00:58:23.640 --> 00:58:25.360
You don't consider me a friend anymore.

00:58:25.360 --> 00:58:27.130
After all this time.

00:58:27.410 --> 00:58:29.810
I promised to get rid of you.

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:30.140
Right?

00:58:30.300 --> 00:58:31.380
Why don't you get rid of me?

00:58:31.640 --> 00:58:32.600
Why didn't you do it?

00:58:33.230 --> 00:58:34.190
You're a fool too!

00:58:34.650 --> 00:58:35.670
You're the one who did it!

00:58:35.690 --> 00:58:36.010
Me?

00:58:36.330 --> 00:58:38.060
Are you making fun of me?

00:58:38.100 --> 00:58:38.780
Don't mess with me!

00:58:38.880 --> 00:58:39.620
Do you hear me?

00:58:40.420 --> 00:58:41.040
I'm sick of you!

00:58:41.360 --> 00:58:47.340
You're crazy!

00:58:47.750 --> 00:58:48.330
Why not?

00:58:48.530 --> 00:58:51.330
You shut up!

00:59:20.700 --> 00:59:23.130
You better get out of here.

00:59:41.160 --> 00:59:45.560
I turned the earth and the sky so that they would not raise accusations against you.

00:59:45.660 --> 00:59:48.240
You are no longer young. Why are you only fighting?

00:59:48.540 --> 00:59:51.310
I don't understand you. You still respect your husband.

00:59:51.570 --> 00:59:52.030
Excuse me.

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:00.980
Why did you get married?

01:00:05.520 --> 01:00:06.960
Sonsia is weaker for two.

01:00:07.340 --> 01:00:08.380
Thick for one.

01:00:08.540 --> 01:00:10.330
Then for a man.

01:00:10.530 --> 01:00:20.220
You plan to return this service to me?

01:00:20.300 --> 01:00:21.970
Do you have any ideas?

01:00:31.050 --> 01:00:31.710
Tell her.

01:00:31.970 --> 01:00:35.360
We're writing from a woman.

01:00:36.190 --> 01:00:39.570
I won't disappoint you in her place.

01:00:47.270 --> 01:00:49.190
We lost a lot of fish, didn't we?

01:00:49.800 --> 01:00:51.750
Yes. From the factory.

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:00.920
I'm going to puke.

01:01:01.620 --> 01:01:02.340
I'm going to stop.

01:01:02.620 --> 01:01:08.420
What do you want?

01:01:08.640 --> 01:01:09.260
Get out of here.

01:01:09.360 --> 01:01:09.640
No.

01:01:09.840 --> 01:01:10.900
You're a liar.

01:01:11.200 --> 01:01:11.580
I'm not.

01:01:11.800 --> 01:01:13.220
Why did you betray me?

01:01:13.360 --> 01:01:14.260
I didn't betray you.

01:01:14.720 --> 01:01:15.920
I'm still loyal to you.

01:01:15.980 --> 01:01:16.800
You're lying.

01:01:17.300 --> 01:01:17.920
Don't you feel it?

01:01:18.120 --> 01:01:20.040
I don't have feelings for you.

01:01:23.140 --> 01:01:24.500
You're just wasting my time.

01:01:24.760 --> 01:01:27.480
You cheated on me and you're trying to take my lake.

01:01:30.670 --> 01:01:37.330
Why not, honey?

01:01:37.510 --> 01:01:37.950
What do you think?

01:01:38.190 --> 01:01:45.540
Don't lie to me.

01:01:45.600 --> 01:01:47.510
I don't want to see him.

01:01:47.730 --> 01:01:48.510
Think about it.

01:01:48.550 --> 01:01:51.540
If you wanted, you could have killed both of us.

01:01:51.800 --> 01:01:52.400
I'm not a liar.

01:01:53.370 --> 01:01:54.110
Listen to me.

01:01:54.250 --> 01:01:59.720
At first I wanted to use you, but then I fell in love with you.

01:02:00.480 --> 01:02:02.440
He wanted you to take the lake from me.

01:02:02.500 --> 01:02:03.720
I don't want it anymore.

01:02:03.780 --> 01:02:06.330
If you don't believe me, give it to him.

01:02:07.040 --> 01:02:09.240
Give the lake to someone before we get married.

01:02:09.440 --> 01:02:13.490
Will I give it to him? And my money?

01:02:14.190 --> 01:02:15.890
We'll deal with it. You'll see.

01:02:16.170 --> 01:02:19.090
It doesn't matter if I give it to him.

01:02:20.030 --> 01:02:22.310
The important thing is that the fish dies.

01:02:23.390 --> 01:02:25.650
I'll go see what Hua has come up with.

01:02:26.120 --> 01:02:26.540
Let's go in.

01:02:26.820 --> 01:02:27.100
No.

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:30.980
Okay, I'll drive you.

01:02:31.020 --> 01:02:33.320
Come in.

01:02:34.460 --> 01:02:34.980
Okay.

01:02:35.200 --> 01:02:44.890
You have a visitor.

01:02:56.230 --> 01:02:56.490
Rebecca.

01:02:56.790 --> 01:02:58.080
Don't talk.

01:02:58.830 --> 01:02:59.470
Go on.

01:03:02.300 --> 01:03:02.960
Take care.

01:03:03.370 --> 01:03:07.300
Yes. I'm sorry.

01:03:07.660 --> 01:03:08.500
Are you angry?

01:03:10.020 --> 01:03:12.520
I'm coming with Mir. Please, withdraw the charges.

01:03:13.000 --> 01:03:13.800
There's no need.

01:03:13.980 --> 01:03:17.250
I'm withdrawing. I just don't want to see you anymore.

01:03:17.990 --> 01:03:19.640
No problem. I'm leaving.

01:03:24.070 --> 01:03:25.770
Why didn't they forgive me?

01:03:26.390 --> 01:03:27.410
Love is a miracle.

01:03:30.220 --> 01:03:32.060
Here. I need a service.

01:03:32.320 --> 01:03:32.560
Yes?

01:03:32.680 --> 01:03:33.140
For free.

01:03:33.500 --> 01:03:34.300
I'm not taking money.

01:03:34.720 --> 01:03:35.120
Come on.

01:03:35.240 --> 01:03:54.970
It's clean.

01:03:56.630 --> 01:03:57.950
There's no need to do that.

01:03:58.270 --> 01:03:59.270
I'm just on strike.

01:04:01.020 --> 01:04:01.820
Okay, I'm leaving.

01:04:02.420 --> 01:04:03.880
I'll be back in 20 minutes.

01:04:04.120 --> 01:04:09.850
For proof that you helped.

01:06:01.180 --> 01:06:03.180
What kind of factory is this?

01:06:40.400 --> 01:06:41.790
Hello. How are you?

01:06:42.940 --> 01:06:46.990
Good. I'm leaving. See you soon.

01:06:52.130 --> 01:06:53.330
Hello. How are you?

01:06:53.410 --> 01:06:53.870
Hi.

01:06:56.920 --> 01:06:57.740
What is that?

01:06:57.980 --> 01:06:59.030
Is that a binocular?

01:07:00.000 --> 01:07:00.320
Take it!

01:07:00.360 --> 01:07:00.740
Take it!

01:07:00.900 --> 01:07:01.220
No!

01:07:02.360 --> 01:07:02.980
Don't you dare!

01:07:04.500 --> 01:07:05.580
Hey, how did you get in here?

01:07:06.030 --> 01:07:06.850
What are you doing here?

01:07:07.070 --> 01:07:08.090
Hello, how are you?

01:07:31.150 --> 01:07:31.650
Hold it.

01:07:33.430 --> 01:07:35.230
Okay. What do you want?

01:07:48.190 --> 01:07:51.570
Take it out.

01:08:36.810 --> 01:08:39.010
Good job. That's how you do it.

01:08:43.670 --> 01:08:44.310
Keep it.

01:08:45.980 --> 01:08:48.640
The Hong Kong district officer discovers the case.

01:08:48.900 --> 01:08:50.530
The two parties are present.

01:08:50.770 --> 01:08:57.880
In the protection of his lake, Mrs. Ye pleads for the prohibition of Mr. Hua's factory work.

01:08:58.040 --> 01:08:58.820
Please pay attention.

01:09:03.050 --> 01:09:08.320
Let me go!

01:09:08.380 --> 01:09:09.100
Let me go right away, you scoundrels!

01:09:30.700 --> 01:09:43.960
If he wakes up, serve him another one. Just a little bit.

01:09:46.560 --> 01:09:49.990
Since I am a native of the Nishitsa, I did not take the tests.

01:09:50.470 --> 01:09:54.270
I worked on a problem together with the staff of the Institute of Oceanography

01:09:54.270 --> 01:09:56.230
to the Ministry of Water in Hong Kong.

01:09:56.410 --> 01:09:59.950
The results show that the contents...

01:10:00.030 --> 01:10:04.770
is 12% higher than the allowed limits.

01:10:19.890 --> 01:10:21.890
Thank you, I have no more questions.

01:10:22.190 --> 01:10:23.260
That was all.

01:10:37.610 --> 01:10:42.630
Mr. Loon, Mrs. Loon's assessments were very professional.

01:10:43.930 --> 01:10:47.630
Therefore, do not use the usual court presentation.

01:10:48.660 --> 01:10:49.380
Yes, Your Honor.

01:11:02.360 --> 01:11:07.130
Miss Nguyen, remember that you promised to tell only the truth.

01:11:07.580 --> 01:11:11.310
Before you give your testimony, remember it.

01:11:11.450 --> 01:11:12.090
I remember it.

01:11:12.390 --> 01:11:12.870
Wonderful.

01:11:13.590 --> 01:11:17.050
In that case, answer the following question sincerely.

01:11:19.960 --> 01:11:20.920
Do you love me?

01:11:24.330 --> 01:11:25.370
What's wrong with him?

01:11:25.410 --> 01:11:28.870
I'm sorry, it's inappropriate.

01:11:29.390 --> 01:11:29.910
Throw him out.

01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:34.440
Let me decide whether to give up.

01:11:34.640 --> 01:11:38.980
If you love her, explain to us.

01:11:39.160 --> 01:11:40.380
Why are you asking?

01:11:40.720 --> 01:11:42.140
Of course, Your Honor.

01:11:42.970 --> 01:11:45.710
I have a reason to ask this question.

01:11:46.580 --> 01:11:47.780
After she answers,

01:11:48.180 --> 01:11:49.750
I will explain it to you.

01:11:52.560 --> 01:11:55.080
Mrs. Ceylon, do you love him?

01:11:55.540 --> 01:11:57.580
Your Honor, let's go back to the waters.

01:11:57.920 --> 01:11:59.820
I am here as an expert...

01:12:00.000 --> 01:12:06.590
Yes, I know why you are here. But apart from expert hydrologist, you are also a woman.

01:12:06.790 --> 01:12:11.660
The court may object if one man asks another man if he loves him.

01:12:12.280 --> 01:12:13.160
This is not normal.

01:12:14.540 --> 01:12:17.960
But in your case, it is normal to be asked.

01:12:18.950 --> 01:12:20.950
You are still a woman. Please answer.

01:12:23.310 --> 01:12:25.680
I can't find a reason not to ask.

01:12:27.480 --> 01:12:28.600
Please answer.

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:32.480
Your Honor, I don't want to talk about love in court.

01:12:33.910 --> 01:12:36.560
No, the court insists you answer.

01:12:37.160 --> 01:12:40.680
Do you love me or not?

01:12:40.880 --> 01:12:43.310
You have to answer.

01:12:43.930 --> 01:12:44.130
No.

01:12:52.880 --> 01:12:54.740
Lying is a crime.

01:12:55.200 --> 01:12:56.280
Don't you know that?

01:12:58.200 --> 01:12:59.520
His tone is frightening.

01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:01.260
But there is a right.

01:13:01.540 --> 01:13:06.140
Forgive me, I'm not kind, but the question is important to me.

01:13:06.570 --> 01:13:08.390
Love is something very serious.

01:13:08.730 --> 01:13:12.250
Eh, answer it seriously.

01:13:14.960 --> 01:13:15.880
Do you love me?

01:13:16.640 --> 01:13:17.480
Why should I answer?

01:13:18.130 --> 01:13:20.270
One answer outside the court is not enough.

01:13:21.000 --> 01:13:23.700
But in court, you have placed a seal.

01:13:24.310 --> 01:13:25.750
You carry responsibility.

01:13:27.190 --> 01:13:28.590
You have to answer me.

01:13:29.240 --> 01:13:29.780
Important.

01:13:31.280 --> 01:13:36.650
This can affect my protection, and not only hers, but also mine.

01:13:37.040 --> 01:13:39.480
The sensitive man is a bit of a troublemaker.

01:13:40.000 --> 01:13:45.990
I'm a judge. I have the right to declare a man innocent, but I can't declare him in love.

01:13:46.840 --> 01:13:50.520
We're waiting to hear the answer. Be honest.

01:13:55.580 --> 01:13:58.610
I love him.

01:14:08.480 --> 01:14:18.950
Your Honor, since we love each other, and we represent different sides, for the good of the deed and each of the two sides, one of us must withdraw.

01:14:20.100 --> 01:14:22.920
Your Honor, please allow this to be me.

01:14:23.180 --> 01:14:28.870
I allow you. The deed will be withdrawn in a week.

01:14:31.330 --> 01:14:32.530
Take care of yourself!

01:14:33.180 --> 01:14:38.560
Bravo to you!

01:14:39.080 --> 01:14:58.010
You didn't give me any opportunity to explain to you.

01:15:01.920 --> 01:15:08.330
I'm sorry. I didn't want you to see me.

01:15:09.260 --> 01:15:10.020
What is it?

01:15:17.750 --> 01:15:18.590
Thank you.

01:15:20.600 --> 01:15:21.500
What's going on?

01:15:21.680 --> 01:15:23.060
Nothing special. You can go.

01:15:23.770 --> 01:15:24.550
Tell me.

01:15:26.070 --> 01:15:27.890
I need the taxi. I have work.

01:15:34.320 --> 01:15:59.960
Boss, let's start with...

01:16:00.090 --> 01:16:02.300
You go there and I go alone.

01:16:02.400 --> 01:16:02.760
Wait here.

01:16:02.920 --> 01:16:03.300
No.

01:16:03.730 --> 01:16:04.350
It will be dangerous.

01:16:04.950 --> 01:16:05.470
I'm not afraid.

01:16:05.830 --> 01:16:06.630
I can't protect you.

01:16:06.810 --> 01:16:08.320
We have to be very quiet.

01:16:08.500 --> 01:16:08.980
Got it?

01:16:09.040 --> 01:16:18.640
Come on, take this.

01:16:18.940 --> 01:16:19.180
Why?

01:16:19.540 --> 01:16:20.230
You'll see.

01:16:32.910 --> 01:16:33.430
You too.

01:16:36.570 --> 01:16:37.240
You too.

01:16:37.480 --> 01:16:44.270
Be careful.

01:16:44.770 --> 01:16:44.950
Okay.

01:17:01.600 --> 01:17:17.920
Throw it in the air.

01:17:18.120 --> 01:17:18.520
Here.

01:17:27.910 --> 01:17:28.410
Don't move.

01:17:28.690 --> 01:17:29.740
We're looking for someone.

01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:30.220
What?

01:17:30.440 --> 01:17:31.980
We are looking for someone.

01:17:34.660 --> 01:17:35.960
There is no one here.

01:17:36.690 --> 01:17:37.130
Nonsense!

01:17:37.600 --> 01:17:38.540
I came with him.

01:17:39.160 --> 01:17:41.020
Your people caught him and drugged him.

01:17:41.440 --> 01:17:41.940
Bring him back.

01:17:42.540 --> 01:17:44.800
Black, this place is mine.

01:17:45.020 --> 01:17:46.000
Get out of here.

01:17:46.100 --> 01:17:46.520
Got it?

01:17:46.940 --> 01:17:48.040
Calm down.

01:17:49.140 --> 01:17:49.700
Come on.

01:17:56.480 --> 01:17:57.660
They are processing drugs.

01:17:58.700 --> 01:17:59.340
Hold them.

01:18:01.670 --> 01:18:13.670
It's dangerous.

01:18:14.360 --> 01:18:15.400
Don't worry about me.

01:18:39.212 --> 01:18:41.212
This is Mayasi.

01:21:00.000 --> 01:21:00.120
Thank you.

01:21:30.670 --> 01:21:30.930
Go to Beadaholique.com for all of your beading supply needs!

01:22:05.308 --> 01:22:09.308
If you kill him, half of the party will be yours.

01:22:10.204 --> 01:22:11.204
I don't know.

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:01.020
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

01:23:35.240 --> 01:23:35.580
You bastard!

01:24:33.520 --> 01:24:34.940
You scoundrel!

01:25:00.090 --> 01:25:00.610
The phone!

01:25:01.560 --> 01:25:02.660
Call the police!

01:25:03.100 --> 01:25:17.970
And the dog!

01:25:18.310 --> 01:25:19.880
They are in my factory!

01:25:32.300 --> 01:25:32.900
Jackie?

01:25:42.720 --> 01:25:43.380
It's the tummy.

01:26:38.090 --> 01:26:38.230
Thank you.

01:27:30.000 --> 01:27:30.200
Thank you.

01:28:00.160 --> 01:28:02.110
How are you? Are you sick?

01:28:02.820 --> 01:28:03.120
No.

01:28:03.340 --> 01:28:04.200
Why did you come?

01:28:04.510 --> 01:28:05.790
I was worried about you.

01:28:06.110 --> 01:28:06.570
There was no reason.

01:28:07.380 --> 01:28:11.390
Come on, man. Wake up. You are heavy as an elephant.

01:28:13.410 --> 01:28:14.590
How are you? Are you okay?

01:28:15.010 --> 01:28:16.420
I think so.

01:28:16.890 --> 01:28:17.330
Precious.

01:28:18.760 --> 01:28:19.200
Precious.

01:28:21.720 --> 01:28:27.500
Hey, so that's what it means.

01:28:32.010 --> 01:28:33.950
You watched the movie Drakon and forever.

01:28:34.650 --> 01:28:36.760
The roles were played by the artists

01:28:37.520 --> 01:28:40.680
Yannitsa Miteva, Nina Gavazova, Nikolay Nikolov,

01:28:40.740 --> 01:28:42.880
Hristo Uzunov, Aleksandar Mitrev,

01:28:42.960 --> 01:28:44.980
the translator Dimitar Milanov.

01:28:45.000 --> 01:28:47.140
Director of the film

01:28:47.140 --> 01:28:49.070
Director of the dubbing

01:28:49.070 --> 01:28:54.740
Director of the dubbing

01:29:00.796 --> 01:29:02.796
You
